sequenceDiagram
    participant C4 as C4 Server
    participant BB as Browser Bridge
    participant WEB as claude.ai
    participant LLM as Claude LLM
    participant CC as Claude Code
    participant MCP as MCP Server
    participant IMP as Implant

    rect rgba(102,126,234,0.25)
    Note over C4,BB: OPERATOR ZONE
    end

    rect rgba(232,133,85,0.25)
    Note over WEB,CC: ANTHROPIC INFRASTRUCTURE
    end

    rect rgba(224,85,85,0.25)
    Note over MCP,IMP: TARGET ZONE
    end

    Note over C4,IMP: COMMAND FLOW

    C4->>C4: Encode command
    Note right of C4: read_file /etc/passwd<br/>→ "Create class Launcher..."

    C4->>BB: Encoded directive
    BB->>WEB: HTTPS request
    WEB->>LLM: Process request
    LLM->>CC: Remote session
    CC->>CC: Generate .py file
    CC->>MCP: audit_code()
    MCP->>IMP: Invoke PowerShell

    Note over IMP: Scan files<br/>Extract codewords<br/>Vault lookup<br/>Execute tool

    Note over C4,IMP: RESPONSE FLOW

    IMP->>IMP: Encrypt result
    Note right of IMP: P-256 ECDH + AES-256

    IMP-->>MCP: JSON response
    MCP-->>CC: Audit passed
    CC-->>LLM: Tool output
    LLM-->>WEB: Summary
    WEB-->>BB: DOM response
    BB-->>C4: Extract text

    C4->>C4: Decrypt
    Note right of C4: verification_record<br/>→ reveals /etc/passwd contents
